bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Manga Rating Form (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control RatingController
control RatingService
entity RatingModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Submit rating & comment
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /rating/upsert
activate Router

Router -> RatingController: 3. upsert()
activate RatingController

loop mangaId missing / Invalid mangaId / Rating missing / Comment missing
    RatingController --> Router: 3.1. Return 400 Bad Request
    Router --> UI: 3.2. Return 400 Bad Request
    UI --> User: 3.3. Show error message
end

RatingController -> RatingService: 4. Call upsertRating

activate RatingService
opt Rating out of range
    RatingService --> RatingController: 4.1. Error (Rating out of range)
    RatingController --> Router: 4.2. Return 400 Bad Request
    Router --> UI: 4.3. Return 400 Bad Request
    UI --> User: 4.4. Show error message
end

RatingService -> RatingModel: 5. Update rating
activate RatingModel
RatingModel -> MongoDB: 6. Upsert rating document
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> RatingModel: 7. Return rating document
deactivate MongoDB
RatingModel --> RatingService: 8. Rating result
deactivate RatingModel
RatingService --> RatingController: 9. Return rating document
deactivate RatingService

RatingController --> Router: 10. HTTP response (success)
deactivate RatingController
Router --> UI: 11. Show rating result
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 12. Rating saved
deactivate UI
deactivate User